      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK EYED BLONDE (3) has been one of the most consistent runners in the field this prep, winning twice and placing on two other occasions from four starts. Fresh off a dominant all the way win at Rockhampton just over 2 weeks ago, she rates as the one to peg back again. LUCKY LASS (4) has been competitive in recent outings and loves her home track, having never missed a cheque here in 5 starts, including 2 wins. She is expected to press forward from the outset, and should be hard to beat again. ENGELINE (6) relocated recently from Victoria, and needed her first Queensland run at Bowen 8 weeks ago. She can only improve from here, so include her in all combos, while FROM THIS MOMENT (1) showed encouraging improvement at Townsville 11 days ago, and she appeals as a worthwhile value top 4 contender. TEN CARAT LUCY (7) has a good draw, and even though this is a step up in class for her, she has all the form on the board, so include her in all combos to be safe.",
